      "category": "passive",
      "placement": "bot",
      "activity": null,
      "traits": [],
      "entries": [
        "A shui gui can Grapple corporeal creatures despite being incorporeal. The shui gui uses its Athletics check to Grapple as normal but can't use Athletics for other actions that require corporeal contact, like Force Open or Trip."
